## What The Indicator Shows On Chart

### Visual Elements

1. **Liquidity Pool Lines** — Dotted horizontal lines at swing highs (orange) and lows (blue)
2. **Equal Level Markers** — `EQH ◆` / `EQL ◆` in gold for premium liquidity targets
3. **Grab Markers** — ✕ marks with wick % when institutional sweeps occur
4. **FVG Boxes** — Semi-transparent zones showing institutional voids
5. **Cascade FVGs** — Thicker bordered, brighter boxes with ⚡score labels
6. **Entry Diamonds** — Diamond shapes with "PERFECT STORM" or "STRONG CASCADE" labels
7. **Real-time Dashboard** — Cascade state, grab quality, volume, active voids, signal counts

### Signal Logic

- **LONG Signal**: Price retests a bullish CASCADE FVG (formed after sellside grab with score ≥ 60)
- **SHORT Signal**: Price retests a bearish CASCADE FVG (formed after buyside grab with score ≥ 60)

> [!TIP]
> The entry occurs at the **FVG retest** — NOT at the grab itself. This is the "optimal trade entry" concept from market microstructure theory.

